    <Definition xsi:type="MyObjectBuilder_ReactorDefinition">
      <Id>
        <TypeId>Reactor</TypeId>
        <SubtypeId>ArcanePower_Thermal_BraytonTrain</SubtypeId>
      </Id>
      <DisplayName>Arcane Turbine</DisplayName>
      <Icon>Textures/GUI/Icons/ArcanePower/Thermal/ArcanePower_Thermal_BraytonTrain.dds</Icon>
      <Description>T1/T2 fuels only; T3 Empyrean requires upgraded turbines. 2 wide x 2 high x 5 long large-grid turbine/compressor. One lower-cell duplex H/C socket. Connect exactly one turbine and cooling per reactor manifold circuit. Keep the four circuits separate; each receives up to one quarter of reactor heat flow. Use the mirrored version for an opposite-side socket. The built-in compressor takes grid power for startup and cooldown; the reactor supplies CO2 internally.</Description>
